      "alt": "BoxPC based on MBa8MPxL",
      "text": "<h1>BoxPC based on MBa8MPxL</h1>\n<p>The Embedded BoxPC ABox-8MPxL is a versatile solution for embedded computing engineers. Based on the MBa8MPxL Single Board Computer (SBC), it features advanced audio capabilities with HiFi4 DSP and a powerful Machine Learning Accelerator with 2.3 TOPS. This BoxPC is designed for high-speed communication, equipped with 2x Gbit Ethernet, 1x PCIe, and 2x USB 3.0 interfaces. It ensures low power consumption (typically 4 W) and integrates essential security functions for industrial applications. The compact design and numerous interfaces make it suitable for various use cases without the need for special design considerations.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 17:44:43 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "altValueFromDAM": "false",
